{"id":276110805,"title":"256. DQL语句-查询语句-排序-聚合函数-多表操作","summary":"数据库-常见的聚合函数的使用（掌握）","content":"<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783412960181-5ef737ff-64a7-4261-8e8b-6f54ba44b630.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783412967094-32461722-bce2-41a2-93d7-929648b3896e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-常见的聚合函数的使用（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783413034599-8f7aaff6-af81-4c15-acfd-c22660586bcd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783413437438-526aae34-d0de-4c0a-a7d7-cd2755c76538.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783413462394-d4aa9886-76dc-43cf-8ed1-adaf4a9ba17b.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783413587273-7c2a58f9-18b1-4c65-b9de-5cab5e68e53f.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783413631516-b2512196-fb74-45ad-897e-0b75786ec4e0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783413641634-b6f4f296-155a-4d1a-88ad-ce1e9d6acd87.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783413731395-34145a19-d105-4437-8da8-97ff6d6d2b46.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783413770757-16e69640-1786-4304-9ecb-ba512bbddd7c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-DQL-对数据进行分组查询（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783413960563-e0367db8-7313-41b4-adfd-6d3455d977e1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414055841-399d7dd3-238e-429f-9cf3-188bc5e54c2f.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414077059-8245dbcc-1916-430d-b9d1-23c25f5dc152.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>保留两位小数<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414111363-2001f518-50aa-4fca-ab8d-2aaae30358de.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414153979-ba45151f-bd5d-4eeb-bf74-a49425c8be26.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>having和group by一起使用的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414237910-e0093839-861f-4604-a89e-fe92c082d6d4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414274172-5a02120e-10d4-48ec-af5c-3fe23d3708bf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414284894-3d61b274-03ee-40df-9300-962734fb26d6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-根据需求创建多张表的分析（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414570350-44b4344a-99ee-47fc-b8be-a5c262364183.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414578089-cc20d1c3-25c1-4583-9973-b89259a28c47.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>创建一个属于歌手的一个表</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414781311-aa22a370-6f4d-447f-aa47-a47b008f9eff.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414722670-96f72e9a-d186-4125-aeec-ce64f68efa83.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414888640-da82d3f1-0130-47a8-9087-ad6846ce6b20.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414899749-aa936805-50c3-4b26-a9d6-4af21de64ce8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们可以通过这个1去另外一个表那里寻找相关数据<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414935344-68fb0ac6-294e-402f-89a9-7b14f1deaf24.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414943504-8e6dc90b-65f7-4647-b080-24eecdb7310d.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783414951205-628a47d0-6ba1-4ad9-9923-de7f33639585.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783415020738-f30932b7-bc56-4c90-9a29-7e99a546a335.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-多张表-添加字段和外键约束（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783415020738-f30932b7-bc56-4c90-9a29-7e99a546a335.png?x-oss-process=image%2Fformat%2Cwebp\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783430366365-88aa2860-fc68-4c2f-b479-9c075f78333d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783430575295-af959ddd-c354-4715-82bd-997ca1fc350b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783430825547-84aaf190-47dc-44c3-a1d5-5fdfe57bf878.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783430835789-5128578c-51a2-4ca2-a7d7-dac7ffc14f30.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783430927410-e6f29da3-06e9-483f-926d-ba7e88946546.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-多张表外键约束更新和删除操作（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783431146845-01aa304a-12fa-47ca-99e6-7ae80fc4011a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783431334424-e5c77fa4-9bdf-40c9-9d49-215a9bf2227a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783431479848-0d513a32-7b8c-4d1d-a205-effa7b07de89.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-多张表-默认的多表查询（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">了解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783431667769-028aaae8-0a7e-46fc-8895-cbb02819f15a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783431654995-cba0b85e-256f-4822-9834-545efccaedd1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783431686806-b9d382a3-5962-4063-ac36-0dea66373125.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这样才是有意义的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783431763712-4b545870-f7b7-4733-947a-12884fba83f2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783431861280-41c1ac16-c287-4ab4-b418-7b32b68d80f9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-多表查询-多种连接查询的方式（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783431898709-cccde47a-fd35-456b-bebd-fc8040f8a5be.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783432044193-76641c38-82c8-4781-8037-b1573e38bc56.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783432070438-cc43daad-6551-432b-805d-4940ee3205ad.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783433403261-31261fe6-4949-4f7b-a400-0630038daced.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783433469265-a7b0a2e6-bd1a-48a2-ba50-44593deb0fb9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>虽然这两个的结果是一样的，但是他们的含义是不一样的。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783433587311-9f47e6cb-104e-41ba-9daf-6097d47aa371.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783433642229-20e88e66-9d2d-46ba-b1fc-66cd8a87bc89.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783433706106-f74c65e7-d276-4ba7-bd1d-02fdbfc36130.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-多对多的关系的表结构（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434194423-ca7bc4ad-eb0c-4b13-83be-f2593bb846ba.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-多对多的查询操作（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434271450-f0b63753-6efc-478b-8fe8-411fea7aa84f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434261787-c1f6fd40-b131-4843-be3a-a75a9607b4ec.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434385895-bbb2293f-e2cf-4ae2-b9d5-cc0ef9f1ea3d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434412919-82d05037-9450-41df-b399-2335dc23ccc9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434466124-75022a09-ab70-4530-857f-30aaf15d520a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434614097-a7529331-f7f4-422f-af43-fbbe192ed6af.png\" alt=\"\">这个是内连接的。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434678764-480ce50c-d480-4087-9740-bf7ac1b6c164.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434703630-0783b4b7-f4e7-4d1a-abba-fb4032b80e06.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434763431-63351436-d8bd-4354-b9d5-21d6dacce944.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>用左连接才可以保证把这个数据显示出来<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434821015-147e6a88-a970-4349-ad30-c37a289faf1f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434848184-c8ace4d7-f040-4254-9424-15ef9d95e456.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434875760-945e4dcf-f095-4f17-8f5b-367f3d57cf39.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们多加一个物理数据进去<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783434935448-981dcdc0-4860-4935-9325-a4687aca81d1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-常见的聚合函数的使用（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783435019154-77761acd-6a88-4a33-9361-180f7af7c549.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783435055762-5febb777-8d01-4aec-8f2f-d932ddfc5a99.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783435088634-974ec11a-f485-4981-b6f0-c69a6de4758d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783435109946-8c86d8a8-5394-4fc2-acd1-dfd506023437.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783435165784-2da2fa4d-c04a-4fc8-8e69-3fa4462ecc42.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783435174261-4ba0d7a2-7b57-49bd-847d-526b5c9ca9f5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783435186500-45c3170b-ece4-4cbc-a315-b753ecb40c24.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":80707835,"category":{"id":80707835,"name":"nodejs","description":""},"created_at":"2026-07-02T06:23:04.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T14:39:57.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hkk7kv/hdg4m1ukiczqa8r0","slug":"hdg4m1ukiczqa8r0","wordCount":313}